# Copyright {% tag numbered="false" /%}

© 2026 ACME Corp. All rights reserved. This manual is assembled from the
section files named in the `sections` manifest — each is rendered in order
into one book, sharing this file's frontmatter (title, version, document
number).

It doubles as a **content showcase**: stitching several `.mdoc` files
together while demonstrating tables, lists, images, callouts, swatches,
columns, code, footnotes, and QR codes. Render with `--assets-root examples`
so the shared example images resolve.

